# HotelOsApps — the application repository.
#
# Mirrors the platform repository's patterns for the things this repo actually
# produces. Kept short deliberately: a long ignore list in a repo that builds
# one .NET project is a list nobody reads before adding to it.

# ---------- secrets ----------
# Never commit. A connector's credentials live in the Token Vault, and a
# package's signing key never enters any repository — README, "The deliverable".
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12

# ---------- .NET ----------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.user

# ---------- packages ----------
# A built `.hopkg` is never committed. It goes stale against its own source and
# gets trusted anyway — the same reason hello-hotel's archive is written to a
# scratchpad and not to the tree.
*.hopkg

# ---------- editors ----------
.idea/
.vscode/
